<title>BOLIVIA: SOCCER-BOLIVAR WIN BOLIVIAN CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BOLIVAR WIN BOLIVIAN CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>COCHABAMBA, Bolivia 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bolivar won the Bolivian soccer championship on Wednesday when they beat Oriente Petrolero 3-1 in a playoff.</p>
<p>It was the tenth time the team from La Paz had won the title since the professional championship was introduced in 1977.</p>
<p>The tournament went to a playoff after the two teams finished level on points at the top of the six-team final stage.</p>
</text>
